{"nodes": [{"id": "examples_voice_frontend_lit_readme_lit_frontend", "label": "Lit frontend (voice sample)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "examples/voice/frontend-lit/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exists alongside the plain HTML reference specifically as a comparison: identical audio plumbing (same WebSocket connect/resume, same per-press MediaRecorder, same per-sender MediaSource) threaded through LitElement lifecycle instead of manual DOM updates, so the delta between the two files is purely the rendering strategy."}, {"id": "examples_voice_frontend_lit_readme_cdn_esm_no_build", "label": "CDN ES-module loading (no build, no node_modules)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "examples/voice/frontend-lit/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lit 3 is pulled from https://esm.sh/lit@3 at runtime so the sample stays a single inspectable file with no toolchain; a production deployment would vite build and drop the CDN."}, {"id": "examples_voice_frontend_lit_readme_reactive_property_rendering", "label": "Reactive properties driving the render", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "examples/voice/frontend-lit/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The point of the Lit variant: state changes propagate to the DOM through declarative reactive properties rather than the hand-written re-render calls the plain version needs."}], "edges": [{"source": "examples_voice_frontend_lit_readme_lit_frontend", "target": "examples_voice_static_lit_index_voiceapp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "examples/voice/frontend-lit/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "examples_voice_frontend_lit_readme_lit_fronten